  "id": "coaching-behavior-assessment-system",
  "term": "Coaching Behavior Assessment System",
  "definition": "The Coaching Behavior Assessment System is an observational method used during games to assess coaches’ reactive behaviors, including their verbal responses to athletes’ performances. In this study, it was used in live competition settings to observe coaching behavior.",
